              "speaker": "K",
              "text": "Hello, I'm Kes. I'm a sound engineer, but I work in communications now. I notice when someone's breathing changes, and I'm gentle and a bit absent-minded. I want someone to ask me to hear something. I'm a bit afraid of silence. How are you?",
